## 10. Summary

This project is a modern expense tracker combining:

- React + Vite frontend for the user interface
- FastAPI + SQLAlchemy backend for business logic and API
- PostgreSQL for reliable storage
- Redis + Celery for background processing
- OCR + ML for receipt intelligence and forecasting
